<title>DUBAI: UAE central bank foreign reserves rise in August.</title>
<headline>UAE central bank foreign reserves rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates foreign currency reserves rose in August to 30.2 billion dirhams from July's 27.5 billion, Central Bank figures show.</p>
<p>(Millions of dirhams, rounded)</p>
<p>				    August 96     July 1996</p>
<p> Assets: Gold		     700		 700</p>
<p> Foreign			 30,200	    27,500</p>
<p> Other assets		     400		 500</p>
<p> Total assets		  31,300	    28,700</p>
<p> Liabilities: CDs	     6,200	     6,300</p>
<p> Other liabilities	    3,800		 600</p>
</text>
